  "solution": "8 and 2\n\nI. __**2 × 4**__ - __**6 ÷ 3**__ + 8 = 14\n\n⇒ __**8**__ - 2 __**+ 8**__ = 14\n\n⇒ 16 - 2 = 14\n\n⇒ 14 = 14\n\nII. 6 - __**2 × 3**__ + __**8 ÷ 1**__ = 9 \n\n⇒ __**6**__ - 6 __**+ 8**__ = 9\n\n⇒ __**14 - 6**__ = 9\n\n⇒ 8 ≠ 9\n\nClearly, equation II will be not correct.\n\nHence, ‘**Only II**’ is the correct answer.",
